# DRC-PDK-3: ihp-sg13g2: a metal1 MOM finger capacitor drawn with box/paint (stand-in for the cap_cmomf generator, design D12) with one finger too close; CAP.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/ihp-sg13g2 -noprompt
snap internal
scalegrid 1 2
drc off
drc euclidean on
snap internal
load mom
box 0 0 1700 120
paint metal1
box 0 1080 1700 1200
paint metal1
box 0 120 80 920
paint metal1
box 160 280 240 1080
paint metal1
box 320 120 400 920
paint metal1
box 480 280 560 1080
paint metal1
box 640 120 720 920
paint metal1
box 800 280 880 1080
paint metal1
box 960 120 1040 920
paint metal1
box 1120 280 1200 1080
paint metal1
box 1280 120 1360 920
paint metal1
box 1440 280 1520 1080
paint metal1
box 0 0 1700 120
paint metal2
box 0 1080 1700 1200
paint metal2
box 40 20 140 100
paint via1
box 40 1100 140 1180
paint via1
box 1540 120 1620 920
paint metal1
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
save mom
